{
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-akosInitiator-7824": "BEN: 大家又各自找乐子去了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-akosInitiator-7825": "BEN: 这儿就是阿科斯。你们大多数人还没来过吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-akosInitiator-7826": "BEN: 大家随便逛逛。我得去处理点……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-akosInitiator-7827": "BEN: 算了，你们还是不知道的好。一两个小时后见。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-benApartmentReturn-7828": "BEN: 怪了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-benApartmentReturn-7829": "BEN: 我的东西都还在……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-benApartmentReturn-7830": "LANDLORD: 谁在里面弄得咣当响！？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-benApartmentReturn-7831": "BEN: 是我，你个老混蛋！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-benApartmentReturn-7832": "LANDLORD: ……本！？你欠了一年房租！还不止！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-benApartmentReturn-7833": "LANDLORD: 欠租全得付清，加上利息，还得预付头尾两个月的房租！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-benApartmentReturn-7834": "BEN: 哦，你还真敢开口啊？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-benApartmentReturn-7835": "BEN: 我给你来点电，算利息……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-benApartmentReturn-7836": "LANDLORD: 想得美，老兄，这房顶上可装着二十来根避雷针。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-benApartmentReturn-7837": "BEN: 等等。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-benApartmentReturn-7838": "BEN: 你怎么没把我的东西清出去？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-benApartmentReturn-7839": "LANDLORD: ……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-benApartmentReturn-7840": "BEN: 你这可怜的老家伙，根本没人肯租，是吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-benApartmentReturn-7841": "LANDLORD: 都怪你！他们怕这地方有诅咒！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-benApartmentReturn-7842": "BEN: 哈！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-benApartmentReturn-7843": "BEN: 我会回来的，等我高兴了再说。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-benApartmentReturn-7844": "BEN: 其他人都跑哪儿去了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-cordeliaAkos-7845": "CORDELIA: 和这里的人交流实在不易。懂那种粗野里恩语方言的人寥寥无几。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-jeromeAkos-7846": "JEROME: 从没见过品质这么好的水果。我祖父可还自己开过果园呢……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-akosAlexJuna-7847": "ALEXANDRA: 朱娜会说一点，呃……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-akosAlexJuna-7848": "JUNA: 堤刻语。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-akosAlexJuna-7849": "ALEXANDRA: 对，那个。但还不足以问清楚，那种漂亮的收音机该去哪儿买。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-akosAlexJuna-7850": "JUNA: 哎，比画比画呗。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-nikolaiAkos-7851": "NIKOLAI: 我？我在找好吃的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-nikolaiAkos-7852": "BEN: 伙计，那你可来对国家了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-zikaronAkos-7853": "ZIKARON: ……阳光……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-akosManLater-7854": "MAN: 嗯……还是不合心意。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-akosWomanLater-7855": "WOMAN: 我丈夫对这里的东西就没满意过，可偏偏每天都要来！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataStalkDiotima-7856": "BEN: 哎，阿伽塔在干什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataStalkDiotima-7857": "BEN: 她好像比平常还绷得紧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataStalkDiotima-7858": "STRANGER: 本·巴拉尼？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataStalkDiotima-7859": "BEN: 是我，怎么了？我欠你钱？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataStalkDiotima-7860": "STRANGER: 恰恰相反，我是来给你送样东西的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataStalkDiotima-7861": "BEN: 能送二十磅米形意面和茄子到我的飞空艇上吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataStalkDiotima-7862": "STRANGER: 不能。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataStalkDiotima-7863": "STRANGER: 我是来揭开一个关于你身世的、尘封已久的秘密。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataStalkDiotima-7864": "BEN: 免了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataStalkDiotima-7865": "STRANGER: 等等，什么？你难道不想知道那令人痛心的真相——",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataStalkDiotima-7866": "BEN: 一点也不想。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataStalkDiotima-7867": "BEN: 又在跟踪危险法师？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataStalkDiotima-7868": "AGATA: 什么？没有，现在别烦我。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataStalkDiotima-7869": "BEN: 你明明就在跟着那个女人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataStalkDiotima-7870": "AGATA: 与你无关。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataStalkDiotima-7871": "BEN: 我大概明白怎么回事了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataStalkDiotima-7872": "BEN: 嗨，不好意思打扰一下。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataStalkDiotima-7873": "????: 你看着可没什么不好意思。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataStalkDiotima-7874": "BEN: 不过，你和我那边的朋友长得太像了，简直像得吓人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataStalkDiotima-7875": "????: 你觉得这么搭讪很潇洒？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataStalkDiotima-7876": "BEN: 我从来就不会那套，现在也不打算学。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataStalkDiotima-7877": "AGATA: 很抱歉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataStalkDiotima-7878": "????: 等等，你是……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataStalkDiotima-7879": "AGATA: 他经常惹出这种事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataStalkDiotima-7880": "????: 我以前在报纸上见过你，你是守护者，对吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataStalkDiotima-7881": "????: 虽然你的肤色浅得多，可你比我还像她。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataStalkDiotima-7882": "AGATA: 像谁？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataStalkDiotima-7883": "????: 我母亲，基娜拉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataStalkDiotima-7884": "????: 也许该说“我们的”母亲，我叫狄奥提玛，很高兴终于见到你了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataStalkDiotima-7885": "AGATA: 我是阿伽塔。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataStalkDiotima-7886": "AGATA: “终于”是什么意思？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataStalkDiotima-7887": "DIOTIMA: 我哥哥和我……一直知道妈妈还有个女儿，事情有点复杂，但也不算什么秘密。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataStalkDiotima-7888": "ALEXANDRA: 等等，所以她到底是不是你的姐妹？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataStalkDiotima-7889": "AGATA: 同母异父的姐姐……至少她这么认为。我不记得父母，只隐约记得自己小时候穿过荒野，来到阿科斯。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataStalkDiotima-7890": "AGATA: 再往后，就只记得自己在守护者的营房里，和一群身世相似的孩子一起长大。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataStalkDiotima-7891": "ALEXANDRA: 怎么才能弄清楚你们是不是一家人？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataStalkDiotima-7892": "BEN: 狄奥提玛说，她哥哥到荒野里去找母亲了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataStalkDiotima-7893": "BEN: 据她说，她母亲大约十二年前离开阿科斯，此后只寄回来过几封信。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataStalkDiotima-7894": "BEN: 说真的，听起来这位基娜拉可不是什么省心的人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataStalkDiotima-7895": "JUNA: （我就爱听这种精彩的家长里短。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataStalkDiotima-7896": "ALEXANDRA: （真的？）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataStalkDiotima-7897": "JUNA: （当然，我们兽群平时大半时间都在闲聊这些。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataStalkDiotima-7898": "AGATA: 我们要找的人，也就是那位可能与我同母异父的哥哥，去了蛮族城镇，想查清母亲的信从哪里寄来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataStalkDiotima-7899": "BEN: 那就从那里找起。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-akosGatherParty-7900": "BEN: （出发前，先把其他人都叫上。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-akosGatherParty-7901": "准备出发了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant1-7902": "MAN: 有什么事？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant1-7903": "AGATA: 是，我们……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant1-7904": "BEN: 找个人，长得很像我这位朋友。他应该打听过一个叫基娜拉的老妇人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant1-7905": "MAN: 我记得他，他愿意花现钱买消息，这在本地可不多见。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant1-7906": "MAN: 他还带着照相机，容易招贼，不过看着挺能应付事的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant1-7907": "AGATA: 你到底给了他什么消息？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant1-7908": "MAN: 他想查几封信是从哪儿寄来的，而我经常替人……私下捎捎信，也算半个邮差吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant1-7909": "MAN: 总之，几周前他往上游去了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant1-7910": "MAN: 免费的消息，就到这儿。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant1-7911": "AGATA: 这些就够了，谢谢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-meetGiorgios-7912": "BEN: 嘿，老兄，你是不是叫乔尔乔斯？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-meetGiorgios-7913": "GIORGIOS: 我现在真的不想被打扰。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-meetGiorgios-7914": "AGATA: 抱歉打扰。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-meetGiorgios-7915": "AGATA: 你非得把动静闹大吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-meetGiorgios-7916": "BEN: 这是阿伽塔，她是你的——",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-meetGiorgios-7917": "GIORGIOS: 不用说了，你和她长得一模一样，声音也像。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-meetGiorgios-7918": "AGATA: 像基娜拉？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-meetGiorgios-7919": "GIORGIOS: 对，很高兴见到你，我妹妹和我一直知道，你就在世上的某个地方。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-meetGiorgios-7920": "GIORGIOS: 你知道基娜拉的事吗？她去世的时候，你在场吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-meetGiorgios-7921": "AGATA: 不，我从没——我完全不记得她。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-meetGiorgios-7922": "GIORGIOS: 啊，那太遗憾了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-meetGiorgios-7923": "GIORGIOS: 我们还以为她在荒野的某个地方跟你一起过日子，要真是那样，至少说明她还在乎谁。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-meetGiorgios-7924": "ALEXANDRA: 所以……她去世了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-meetGiorgios-7925": "GIORGIOS: 对，这里的负责人说她两年前就去世了，我们很久没收到她的信，也早有预感。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-meetGiorgios-7926": "GIORGIOS: 不过法律上需要证明，所以我带了照相机。希望一份签字文件，再加上墓碑的照片，能让法院认可。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-meetGiorgios-7927": "AGATA: 听起来不难。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-meetGiorgios-7928": "GIORGIOS: 没那么容易，她葬在上面的崖边，可现在有只魔法鸟在附近筑了巢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-meetGiorgios-7929": "GIORGIOS: 个头特别大，我没办法靠近坟墓。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-meetGiorgios-7930": "JUNA: 是御风猎手吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-meetGiorgios-7931": "ALEXANDRA: 就是跟着你跑进动物园的那种？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-meetGiorgios-7932": "JUNA: 这回换别人闯进它家，看它乐不乐意。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-meetGiorgios-7933": "GIORGIOS: 如果你们肯帮忙，那就太感谢了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-kordyneKynara-7934": "KORDYNE: 啊，你就是基娜拉的女儿。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-kordyneKynara-7935": "AGATA: 是，她来这里是为了当某种……女祭司之类的吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-kordyneKynara-7936": "KORDYNE: 不完全是。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-kordyneKynara-7937": "KORDYNE: 她刚来的时候，我以为她和其他来这里的人一样，是个逃离文明的绝望之人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-kordyneKynara-7938": "KORDYNE: 也许确实如此，她帮我照顾过一阵缄默者。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-kordyneKynara-7939": "KORDYNE: 过了几年她便离开了，我想是向西去了另一座城市。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-kordyneKynara-7940": "KORDYNE: 据我所知，她在那座城市里，也过了另一番完整的人生。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-kordyneKynara-7941": "KORDYNE: 离开约八年后，她又回到这里，一直住到两年前突然去世。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-kordyneKynara-7942": "ALEXANDRA: 她想要什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-kordyneKynara-7943": "KORDYNE: 我想她想要的东西很多，却往往彼此矛盾。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-kordyneKynara-7944": "KORDYNE: 她更愿意向过路的旅人和朝圣者吐露心事，跟他们说的，远比跟我说的多。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-kordyneKynara-7945": "KORDYNE: 抱歉，没法告诉你更多了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-kynaraGrave-7946": "AGATA: 坟墓就在这些里面？没看到什么大鸟。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-kynaraGrave-7947": "JUNA: 对啊，它们就是这样，让你看不见。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-kynaraGrave-7948": "AGATA: 安全了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-kynaraGrave-7949": "GIORGIOS: 谢谢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-kynaraGrave-7950": "GIORGIOS: 石碑上确实是她的名字，让我拍张清晰点的照片。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-kynaraGrave-7951": "GIORGIOS: 好了，谢谢帮忙。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-kynaraGrave-7952": "ALEXANDRA: 就这样？她不是……你妈妈吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-kynaraGrave-7953": "GIORGIOS: 你得明白……我母亲和别人不一样。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-kynaraGrave-7954": "GIORGIOS: 她总是说走就走，我们放学回家，就会发现她连人带东西都不见了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-kynaraGrave-7955": "GIORGIOS: 开始只是偶尔走上几天，后来一走就是几周，再后来便是一两个月。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-kynaraGrave-7956": "GIORGIOS: 然后，她在狄奥提玛生日的前一天离开了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-kynaraGrave-7957": "GIORGIOS: 据我们所知，她想穿过去，到西边的另一座城市，却被说杰兰德语的蛮族抓走了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-kynaraGrave-7958": "GIORGIOS: 她被囚禁了大约四年。你就是在那期间出生的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-kynaraGrave-7959": "GIORGIOS: 她回来后是这么说的，不过有些地方说不通。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-kynaraGrave-7960": "GIORGIOS: 总之，这个给你。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-kynaraGrave-7961": "获得部族珠饰！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-kynaraGrave-7962": "AGATA: 这是什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-kynaraGrave-7963": "GIORGIOS: 这是某个蛮族部落的护符，有位旅人告诉我，它是族人的身份标志。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-kynaraGrave-7964": "GIORGIOS: 妈妈一直带着它，不过我觉得这本来就是你的东西，所以她才一直留着。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-kynaraGrave-7965": "AGATA: 你觉得，我能找到囚禁她的那个部族吗？找到我的……亲人？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-kynaraGrave-7966": "GIORGIOS: 也许吧，你要是不想再追究，我也理解，可再想问妈妈真相，已经来不及了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-kynaraGrave-7967": "GIORGIOS: 去蛮族城镇打听打听，也许有人认得这护符属于哪个部族。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant2-7968": "MAN: 又回来了？这一趟挺快啊。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant2-7969": "AGATA: 能告诉我们，这些珠饰属于谁吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant2-7970": "MAN: 能，但我不说。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant2-7971": "BEN: 就知道你会这么说。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant2-7972": "MAN: 这地方消息少，我有，你们想要。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant2-7973": "MAN: 而你们能给我别人给不了的东西。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant2-7974": "BEN: 我倒要听听。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant2-7975": "MAN: 大家都在说的那艘会飞的船，肯定是你们的吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant2-7976": "MAN: 能装多少人，二十？三十？要是能帮我运货……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant2-7977": "BEN: 不成交，没门，想都别想。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant2-7978": "AGATA: 什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant2-7979": "BEN: 他的货就是他们，这些孩子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant2-7980": "BEN: 我可不帮人贩卖孩子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant2-7981": "AGATA: 你不明白。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant2-7982": "BEN: 不，我看是你不明白。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant2-7983": "BEN: 换个交易怎么样？你放了这些孩子，告诉我们想知道的事，我就不把你家炸个稀巴烂。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant2-7984": "BEN: 没有附加条件。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant2-7985": "MAN: 杀了我，也断不了奴隶的来源。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant2-7986": "MAN: 自会有人接替，而我从不损坏货物，口碑好得很。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant2-7987": "MAN: 换个人来做，只会比我糟得多，到时你连去哪儿找他都不知道。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant2-7988": "AGATA: 能请你出来说两句吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant2-7989": "AGATA: 你不了解这里的规矩。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant2-7990": "BEN: 我不管这里什么规矩，我们不会运孩子去当奴隶。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant2-7991": "BEN: 而且我要把那混蛋电个够。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant2-7992": "AGATA: 那些孩子会被送往阿科斯，卖给守护者团。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant2-7993": "BEN: 所以呢？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant2-7994": "AGATA: 守护者团负责监管堤刻的魔法，只有永远无法获得魔法的人，才能担任成员。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant2-7995": "ALEXANDRA: 在我那个世界出生的孩子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant2-7996": "AGATA: 对，我们当时不知道世界分裂的事，但知道西方的部族永远不会获得魔法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant2-7997": "AGATA: 那些部族又不断相互袭击、俘虏对方……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant2-7998": "BEN: 所以顺手赚上几块钱，又有什么坏处？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant2-7999": "BEN: 得了吧，少跟我扯这些。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant2-8000": "AGATA: 一进营房，那些孩子在法律上就是自由人，也可以离开——",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant2-8001": "YOUNG WOMAN: 抱歉打断一下，我刚才都听见了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant2-8002": "YOUNG WOMAN: 和你们谈生意的是我父亲，他不会老实跟你们交易，不过那些珠饰我也许认得。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant2-8003": "AGATA: 好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant2-8004": "YOUNG WOMAN: 嗯，我认得，这是阿斯库扎雅部族的护符，你和他们有亲缘关系？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant2-8005": "AGATA: 我不知道。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant2-8006": "AGATA: 你知道他们在哪一带狩猎吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant2-8007": "YOUNG WOMAN: 听说天气暖和的时候，他们喜欢在这里东南偏东的半岛上打猎、捕鱼。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant2-8008": "YOUNG WOMAN: 希望能帮上忙。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-slaveMerchant2-8009": "BEN: 我和这家伙的事还没完……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-askuzayaEnter-8010": "BARBARIAN: 什么人？你不是部族的朋友。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-askuzayaEnter-8011": "BARBARIAN: 营地里不做买卖。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-askuzayaEnter-8012": "AGATA: 我们……不是商人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-askuzayaEnter-8013": "BEN: 你一紧张，还真够腼腆的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-askuzayaEnter-8014": "BEN: 这些珠饰是我这位朋友的，你们是同一个部族的吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-askuzayaEnter-8015": "BARBARIAN: 这是你的诞生护符？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-askuzayaEnter-8016": "AGATA: 是吗？它一直在我母亲身上。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-askuzayaEnter-8017": "BARBARIAN: 进来吧，你该去见见族长们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-barbarianGuardL-8018": "BARBARIAN: 进来吧，你该去见见族长们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-barbarianGuardR-8019": "BARBARIAN: 去找族长们谈谈。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-siopeTraveler5later-8020": "MAN: 看来别人都听说那些幻影消失了，要是我们也听说了就好了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-askuzayaReject-8021": "BARBARIAN: 走开，这里只接待族人和盟友。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-meetBrothersPal-8022": "PALUKUS: 妹妹，早点再来看我们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-meetBrothersSkil-8023": "SKILURUS: 希望你这一路走下去，很快又会回到这里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-sparBrothers-8024": "准备好与我们比试，取得你的遗产了吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-sparBrothers-8025": "没有",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-sparBrothers-8026": "准备好了就说一声。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-sparBrothers-8027": "准备好了",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-sparBrothers-8028": "好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-camperG2-8029": "GIRL: 鱼明明这么近，为什么比兔子还难射中？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-camperF-8030": "FATHER: 得瞄得近一点，水会让你看错位置。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-camperM3-8031": "MAN: 你是我们族人？哦，你是守护者。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-camperM3-8032": "MAN: 我们有几个族人最后也去了那里，有些后来回来了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-camperG1-8033": "GIRL: 为什么井水比池塘里的水好？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-camperW2-8034": "WOMAN: 用身体的重量把桶拉起来，别光靠手臂。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-camperB1-8035": "BOY: 短一点，到底要多短？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-camperW3-8036": "GRANDMOTHER: 想射得更远，箭羽就得用短些的羽毛。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-camperW3-8037": "GRANDMOTHER: 又一副神谕牌？还以为再也见不到了，能陪我玩一局吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-camperW3-8038": "不了，谢谢",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-camperW3-8039": "来一局！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-camperW3-8040": "GRANDMOTHER: 玩得好，孩子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-camperW3-8041": "GRANDMOTHER: 这个，你比我更用得上。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-camperW3-8042": "获得速度宝典！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-camperW3-8043": "GRANDMOTHER: 哎呀，这也是常有的事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-camperM1-8044": "MAN: 这里就缺能晒成干草的长草，全让野兽吃光了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-camperM2-8045": "MAN: 这里猎物从来不缺，就是把兽皮大老远运到商镇太麻烦。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-camperW1-8046": "WOMAN: 你们穿过暴雨之门了？错过那里，就回不了南方的城镇。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-camperB2-8047": "BOY: 这里除了我们又没别人，为什么还要站岗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-camperM5-8048": "MAN: 为的是永远不丢掉这个习惯。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-brothersStart-8049": "BEN: 你看着像族长。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-brothersStart-8050": "AGATA: 我求你闭嘴吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-brothersStart-8051": "????: 他们那边的人，永远不知道什么时候该闭嘴。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-brothersStart-8052": "????: 带着诞生护符来的就是你？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-brothersStart-8053": "AGATA: 是的，我是守护者团的阿伽塔。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-brothersStart-8054": "????: 她成了守护者，嗯。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-brothersStart-8055": "????: 看见她，真有点恍惚。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-brothersStart-8056": "AGATA: 什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-brothersStart-8057": "????: 你和基娜拉长得一模一样。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-brothersStart-8058": "AGATA: 你们……认识她？连名字都知道？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-brothersStart-8059": "????: 她是我们父亲最后一任妻子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-brothersStart-8060": "????: 我是斯基卢鲁斯，这是我兄弟帕卢库斯，我们都是阿泰亚斯的儿子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-brothersStart-8061": "PALUKUS: 留下来吃顿宴席吧？你的朋友也是我们的客人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-barbFeastStopSouth-8062": "AGATA: （外面一片漆黑。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-barbFeastStopNorth-8063": "AGATA: （外面一片漆黑。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-feastFishTalk-8064": "MAN: 大家要我连夜抓鱼，好让这家伙接着做菜……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-feastZikaron-8065": "ZIKARON: ……庆祝……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-feastNikolai-8066": "NIKOLAI: 这些谷物都是手磨的？我父亲见了准得受不了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-feastBen-8067": "BEN: 他们做菜的路数……不怎么样。不过找香草倒是真有一手。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-feastBen-8068": "BEN: 我给你专门留一盘。今天可是为你办的宴席！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-feastGrandma-8069": "OLD WOMAN: 他选的食材我不太看得懂，不过做菜又多又快……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-feastSon-8070": "BOY: 再来一次！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-feastDaughter-8071": "GIRL: 就是这样！不过平常还有音乐。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-feastGirl-8072": "GIRL: 你长得像我们……却是在南方那座城里长大的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-cordWomanFeast-8073": "WOMAN: 血脉很重要，不过族长也能通过仪式，把外人纳入我们的血脉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-cordWomanFeast-8074": "WOMAN: 希望他把那个胖男人也收进来，他做菜真好吃。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-jeromeManFeast-8075": "MAN: 一年里大部分时候我们都待在雨门这边，因为有魔法的部族行事更不顾忌。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-cordeliaFeastTalk-8076": "CORDELIA: 有意思。据他们说，族长正是看中了斯基卢鲁斯的魔法，才将他收为养子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-cordeliaFeastTalk-8077": "CORDELIA: 他们或是收养孩子，或是在迁徙时，让一些女子在你的世界生产。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-cordeliaFeastTalk-8078": "CORDELIA: 这些部族早就知道世界分裂了，我们却浑然不觉。对我们的文明而言，实在算不上光彩。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-jeromeFeast-8079": "JEROME: 真不敢想，他们的医者要是自己受伤或生病，该怎么办。求援就得走上好几个星期。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-feastAlex-8080": "ALEXANDRA: 我喝过佐餐酒，可这个喝得我……嗝……好困。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-feastSide1-8081": "MAN: 我记得基娜拉，她摆弄部族内部关系的本事，让人以为她从小就在我们中间长大。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-feastSide2-8082": "MAN: 基娜拉是你母亲？我只和她说过几次话，那时我也年轻。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-feastJuna-8083": "JUNA: 这人说他认识别的尤鲁兽。有些也许为了避难，来到了这个世界。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-feastJunaMan-8084": "MAN: 对，那些会说话的风之兽，我记得它们还问过我路，当时真不敢相信！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-feastJunaMan-8085": "MAN: 今年确实看见一群往北去了，但没机会跟它们说话。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-feastLWoman-8086": "WOMAN: 老天，你可真像基娜拉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-feastLWoman-8087": "WOMAN: 她常给我讲雨门另一边那座大城的故事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-feastMom2-8088": "WOMAN: 不，我不认识你母亲，我是后来嫁进部族的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-otherFeastMom-8089": "WOMAN: 我怀孕了，他们想让我到雨门另一边生，这样孩子就可能拥有风之力。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-feastFather-8090": "MAN: 再过两个月，我们才会回西边去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-feastFather-8091": "MAN: 你该多回来看看，族长们虽然不表露出来，但我知道他们很高兴见到你。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-feastFireMan1-8092": "MAN: 今年雨水好，可也就没多少干柴了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-feastSon2-8093": "BOY: 你是我们族里的？那我能去大城里找你玩吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-brothersExpo-8094": "PALUKUS: 见到你，真是奇妙。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-brothersExpo-8095": "PALUKUS: 你像父亲一样高挑、肤色浅，可哪怕还是婴儿时，模样就已经和基娜拉一模一样。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-brothersExpo-8096": "SKILURUS: 我们不太喜欢她，她把父亲拿捏得死死的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-brothersExpo-8097": "AGATA: 等等，我以为基娜拉是俘虏？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-brothersExpo-8098": "SKILURUS: 起先确实是，大约当了……一个月的俘虏？后来我们才弄明白，她的族人离得太远，根本没法索要赎金。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-brothersExpo-8099": "PALUKUS: 再后来，她就成了父亲的妻子。为了找来她在城里用惯的东西，她总让父亲出去劫掠。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-brothersExpo-8100": "SKILURUS: 一年以后，就有了你。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-brothersExpo-8101": "PALUKUS: 你那件诞生护符还没做完，按规矩，那得由母亲来做。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-brothersExpo-8102": "PALUKUS: 可基娜拉不爱干这些费力的活。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-brothersExpo-8103": "AGATA: 我们的父亲后来怎么样了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-brothersExpo-8104": "PALUKUS: 阿泰亚斯？他那时已经老了，带队劫掠时死了，正是他想要的归宿。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-brothersExpo-8105": "SKILURUS: 不过，如果你是想问自己为什么被卖去大城，那是因为父亲的一位亲戚接管了部族。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-brothersExpo-8106": "SKILURUS: 他把我们也赶走了，那时我们还年轻，不过后来我们回来，和他了结了此事，如今部族是我们的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-brothersExpo-8107": "PALUKUS: 不说那些了，讲讲你自己的生活吧，你当上了守护者？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-brothersExpo-8108": "AGATA: 我……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-brothersExpo-8109": "AGATA: 真不知道该从何说起。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-brothersExpo-8110": "PALUKUS: 走之前还有一件事，你应得的遗产，有一部分在我们这里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-brothersExpo-8111": "SKILURUS: 我们两个都不用父亲的长矛，不过要继承武器，得先被部族承认为成年人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-brothersExpo-8112": "PALUKUS: 也就是说，你和同伴得跟我们比试一场，好好露一手，让我们看看守护者的本事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-diotimaNPC-8113": "DIOTIMA: 等你查清楚了，真想听你说说。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-diotimaNPC-8114": "DIOTIMA: 最近好吗？又见到你，真高兴。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataFinale-8115": "DIOTIMA: 阿伽塔！你回来了！找到乔尔乔斯了吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataFinale-8116": "AGATA: 找到了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataFinale-8117": "AGATA: 还有我的……另外几位兄长。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataFinale-8118": "DIOTIMA: 你的什么？快说给我听！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataFinale-8119": "DIOTIMA: 这么说，她嫁给了蛮族族长……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataFinale-8120": "DIOTIMA: 要是她亲口告诉我……我都不知道自己会不会信。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataFinale-8121": "AGATA: 她从没提过这些？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataFinale-8122": "DIOTIMA: 她回来时，对我来说已经像个陌生人了，毕竟她第一次离开那阵，我还很小。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataFinale-8123": "DIOTIMA: 而且她在家停留的时间又那么短，我根本来不及多了解她。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataFinale-8124": "DIOTIMA: 我们发现她常去守护者那里打听一个小女孩，所以就猜她还有个孩子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataFinale-8125": "DIOTIMA: 可接着她又消失了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataFinale-8126": "AGATA: 那会……很难过吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataFinale-8127": "DIOTIMA: 对我来说，她只是个出现在家里的陌生女人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataFinale-8128": "DIOTIMA: 可乔尔乔斯比我大，还记得小时候有妈妈陪着的日子，所以她再次离开时，他真的很难过。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataFinale-8129": "DIOTIMA: 你说，你也不太记得她？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataFinale-8130": "AGATA: 完全不记得。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataFinale-8131": "AGATA: 我是在守护者的营房里长大的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataFinale-8132": "DIOTIMA: 那一定不容易。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataFinale-8133": "AGATA: 营房里的人都和我一样，来自说杰兰德语的部族。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataFinale-8134": "AGATA: 我们把养大自己的那些人叫作阿姨、叔叔和奶奶，那样的生活其实和部族里没有太大区别。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataFinale-8135": "AGATA: 我们也不知道还有别的活法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataFinale-8136": "DIOTIMA: 我还查到了一些妈妈的事，因为好奇，就去寻找她的亲戚。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataFinale-8137": "DIOTIMA: 最后找到她的一位亲戚，那人说妈妈小时候，她父亲换工作很勤，什么都做不长。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataFinale-8138": "DIOTIMA: 他总带着一家人搬来搬去，在什么地方都住不长。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataFinale-8139": "DIOTIMA: 我想，妈妈大概就是那时习惯了这种生活，总要离开熟悉的一切，换个地方重新开始。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataFinale-8140": "DIOTIMA: 听那位亲戚说，我还有个姨妈。她去世的时候，和妈妈一样，都才十几岁。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataFinale-8141": "DIOTIMA: 姨妈的名字叫阿伽莎。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataFinale-8142": "AGATA: 他们一直跟我说，我取的是个堤刻名字。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataFinale-8143": "AGATA: 可营房里大家都说杰兰德语，所以“th”这个音，我长大了才会发。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataFinale-8144": "DIOTIMA: 知道真相后，你高兴吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataFinale-8145": "DIOTIMA: 就算不高兴也没关系，别为了顾及我，勉强自己非得有什么感受。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataFinale-8146": "AGATA: 能遇见那些告诉我真相的人，我很高兴。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataFinale-8147": "DIOTIMA: 我也是。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-agataFinale-8148": "BEN: （我也是。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-fSpot1-8149": "FISHERMAN: 你好啊！看着不像来钓鱼的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-fSpot1-8150": "FISHERMAN: 阿斯……酸奶酱？没听过。我们的守卫都是提拉泰部族的人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-fSpot2-8151": "FISHERMAN: 每年这个时候的鲑鱼洄游，那可是出了名的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-fSpot3-8152": "FISHERMAN: 阿斯库扎雅？以前倒有种鱼，叫阿斯库扎雅鳟鱼。旧指南和年鉴都说，这条河里有。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-fSpot3-8153": "FISHERMAN: 可那些书里记的河宽，大约还是眼前的四倍呢。所以，记载也许早就过时了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-fSpot3-8154": "FISHERMAN: 今年鲑鱼洄游的情况很好，也没什么部族冲突需要处理。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-fSpot4-8155": "FISHERMAN: 你以为阿科斯那么多鱼鲜都是哪儿来的？他们早就把海湾捕得没什么鱼了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-fSpotG1-8156": "BARBARIAN: 阿斯库扎雅部族？从没见过他们，好像听过这个名字，可记不起在哪儿了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-fSpotG1-8157": "BARBARIAN: 部族的朋友才能在这里捕鱼，我们族里可从来没人当过守护者。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-fSpotG2-8158": "BARBARIAN: 阿斯库扎雅？我没见过，不过族人唱的歌里有他们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-fSpotG2-8159": "BARBARIAN: 有首歌说，他们就住在西边的河对岸，我们从前常与他们交战。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-fSpotG2-8160": "BARBARIAN: 还有首歌告诫孩子，取水时要提防阿斯库扎雅人，好像一不留神，他们就会把你掳走。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-fSpotG2-8161": "BARBARIAN: 可连我曾祖父都不记得见过他们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-fSpotG2-8162": "BARBARIAN: 你是守护者？城里人总说你们长得像我们，可我们族人从没被带去那里过。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-javelinCaveBoss-8163": "BARBARIAN: 做得好，奖励就在后面。看吧，神威标枪！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-leaveTrial-8164": "要离开试炼吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-leaveTrial-8165": "否",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-leaveTrial-8166": "是",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-camperW4-8167": "WOMAN: 我们很重视待客之道，但也不是什么陌生人都招待。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-fishingWomanHintA-8168": "WOMAN: 曾祖母说过，我们以前为争夺这一带洄游的鱼群，和另外三个部族打过仗。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-fishingWomanHintA-8169": "WOMAN: 可有一年春天来了场可怕的风暴，其他部族全都消失了，连森林也不见了一大半！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/agataSidequest.yarn-fishingWomanHintA-8170": "WOMAN: 老故事里说，穿过森林要走四天，可现在一天就能走完。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3430": "Title: 回团复命",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3431": "Description: 返回本的世界，前往阿科斯向守护者团复命。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3432": "Title: 啊，又去那里？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3433": "Description: 前往阿科斯西北偏北的梅尔多约，寻找乔尔乔斯。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3434": "Title: 他往北去了",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3435": "Description: 返回梅尔多约正北方的西奥佩修道院。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3436": "Title: 死亡的证明",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3437": "Description: 前往西奥佩修道院上方的山坡，为墓碑拍照。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3438": "Title: 行家鉴定",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3439": "Description: 返回梅尔多约，向情报贩子打听阿伽塔的珠饰。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3440": "Title: 谁？在哪里？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3441": "Description: 在东南偏东的半岛上寻找阿斯库扎雅营地。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3442": "Title: 会面",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3443": "Description: 与阿斯库扎雅营地的族长们交谈。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3444": "Title: 一家人过过招",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3445": "Description: 与阿伽塔同父异母的兄弟切磋，取得她父亲的长矛。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3446": "Title: 尘埃落定之后",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3447": "Description: 返回阿科斯，与狄奥提玛交谈。"
}
